  "description": "<p>We have had several requests for the version of fedora to be advertised via HTTP somehow. </p>\n\n<p>Obvious candidates for this are </p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>new endpoint fcr:version which responds with a simple text string,</li>\n\t<li>add field to fcr:stats json response</li>\n\t<li>add a custom HTTP header e.g. “Fcrepo-version: 6.4.1” so as not to clash with existing Server header</li>\n</ul>\n",
